        "Example adapted prompt: client performance report\nUsing only the supplied reporting data, prepare a concise monthly update for [BUSINESS]. Report traffic, calls, forms, qualified leads, booked jobs, completed jobs, and revenue only where those figures are available. Compare against the previous period only when comparable data exists.",
        "Explain what changed, what was tested, what was learned, what remains uncertain, and the next three actions. Clearly label missing or incomplete tracking. Do not attribute revenue changes to the funnel unless the evidence supports that conclusion."
