        "I noticed that the page [describe one verifiable issue—for example, the ad promotes emergency repair, but the landing page opens with a general company introduction and the call action is difficult to find on mobile].",
        "That may be creating unnecessary friction for people who are already looking for [service].",
        "I put together a short example showing how I would make the page continue the ad's message and make the next step clearer: [link, if appropriate].",
        "No need to book a demo. I thought it might be useful to share because it is a specific improvement you can evaluate.",
